op:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Osaka-Mono,monospace;font-size:14.6667px;line-height:1.45;margin-bottom:0px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;margin-top:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Can someone explain this? Here is my code:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Osaka-Mono,monospace;font-size:14.6667px;line-height:1.45;margin-bottom:0px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;margin-top:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></div><div><b># Standardizing variables<br>df2_EFA_scaled &lt;- as.data.frame(scale(df2_EFA))<br><br><br>#define your model<br>CFA_model &lt;- &#39;<br>  Physicallimitations =~ BikeRidingAbilityNumeric +Q9_2 +Q9_1 + Q9_4<br>  Attitudes =~ BikingComfortLevelNumeric + ParkingPermitUseNumericQ23 + Q3_numeric + Q18_numeric<br>  Commutingexperience =~ Transportation_Numeric + Q14_numeric + Q11_19 <br>  Convenience =~ Q8_numeric + sum_Q13 + Q4_numeric<br>  Travelpreferences =~ Q26_6 + Q26_5 +Q26_2 + Q26_7 + Q26_3 + Q26_4<br>&#39;<br>```<br><br><br>```{r}<br>#fit the model<br><br>fit &lt;- cfa(model=CFA_model, data=df2_EFA)<br>```<br><br>```{r}<br>#summarizing the results <br><br>summary(fit, fit.measures = TRUE)</b></div><div><b><span style=\"font-family:Osaka-Mono,monospace;font-size:14.6667px;line-height:1.45;margin-bottom:0px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;margin-top:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></b></div><div><b><span style=\"font-family:Osaka-Mono,monospace;font-size:14.6667px;line-height:1.45;margin-bottom:0px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;margin-top:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></b></div>"
